        {
          "id": "p1-1",
          "speaker": "Man",
          "text": "Hello. Do you mind if I ask you some questions about your journey today? We’re doing a customer satisfaction survey."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-2",
          "speaker": "Sophie",
          "text": "Yes. OK. I’ve got about ten minutes before my train home leaves. I’m on a day trip."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-3",
          "speaker": "Man",
          "text": "Great. Thank you. So first of all, could you tell me your name?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-4",
          "speaker": "Sophie",
          "text": "It’s Sophie Bird."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-5",
          "speaker": "Man",
          "text": "Thank you. And would you mind telling me what you do?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-6",
          "speaker": "Sophie",
          "text": "I’m a journalist."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-7",
          "speaker": "Man",
          "text": "Oh really? That must be interesting."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-8",
          "speaker": "Sophie",
          "text": "Yes. It is."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-9",
          "speaker": "Man",
          "text": "So was the reason for your visit here today work?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-10",
          "speaker": "Sophie",
          "text": "Actually, it’s my day off. I came here to do some shopping."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-11",
          "speaker": "Man",
          "text": "On right."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-12",
          "speaker": "Sophie",
          "text": "But I do sometimes come here for work."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-13",
          "speaker": "Man",
          "text": "OK. Now I’d like to ask some questions about your journey today, if that’s OK."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-14",
          "speaker": "Sophie",
          "text": "Yes. No problem."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-15",
          "speaker": "Man",
          "text": "Right, so can you tell me which station you’re travelling back to?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-16",
          "speaker": "Sophie",
          "text": "Staunfirth, where I live."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-17",
          "speaker": "Man",
          "text": "Can I just check the spelling? S-T-A-U-N-F-I-R-T-H?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-18",
          "speaker": "Sophie",
          "text": "That’s right."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-19",
          "speaker": "Man",
          "text": "And you travelled from there this morning?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-20",
          "speaker": "Sophie",
          "text": "Yes."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-21",
          "speaker": "Man",
          "text": "OK, good. Next, can I ask what kind of ticket you bought? I assume it wasn’t a season ticket, as you don’t travel every day."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-22",
          "speaker": "Sophie",
          "text": "That’s right. No, I just got a normal return ticket. I don’t have a rail card so I didn’t get any discount. I keep meaning to get one because it’s a lot cheaper."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-23",
          "speaker": "Man",
          "text": "Yes - you’d have saved 20% on your ticket today. So you paid the full price for your ticket?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-24",
          "speaker": "Sophie",
          "text": "I paid £23.70."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-25",
          "speaker": "Man",
          "text": "OK. Do you think that’s good value for money?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-26",
          "speaker": "Sophie",
          "text": "Not really. I think it’s too much for a journey that only takes 45 minutes."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-27",
          "speaker": "Man",
          "text": "Yes, that’s one of the main complaints we get. So, you didn’t buy your ticket in advance?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-28",
          "speaker": "Sophie",
          "text": "No. I know it’s cheaper if you buy a week in advance but I didn’t know I was coming then."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-29",
          "speaker": "Man",
          "text": "I know. You can’t always plan ahead. So, did you buy it this morning?"
